                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">各位教工：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">现将经多次研讨、修订的《</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">绍兴一中高级教师首次星级评定方案》发布如下,并再次向大家征集意见，欢迎提出宝贵意见，有意见的教工请把《教工意见反馈表》按要求填写好后于3月24日（<SPAN lang=EN-US>周四</SPAN>）下午<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>前投入行政楼一楼意见箱内，谢谢！</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"></SPAN></FONT> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"></SPAN></FONT> </P><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">绍兴一中高级教师首次星级评定方案<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">为了继续加强教师队伍建设，搭建教师专业发展平台，完善高级教师持续动力激励机制，推动高级教师在师德修养、教育教学、教学科研、青年教师培养等方面起到示范和引领作用，引导高级教师牢固树立珍惜岗位、履行职责、积极进取、终身学习的观念，进一步提高教师队伍整体素质，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">按照市教育局《市属学校高级教师星级评</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">定方案（试行）》，结合本校实际，本着“公平、公正、竞争、择优、动态管理”的原则，制订本方案。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">一、星级评定对象<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">具有中学高级教师资格，并被学校当年聘任的一线在职教师，可申报参加星级评定。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">55</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">岁以上的男高级教师、<SPAN lang=EN-US>50</SPAN>岁以上的女高级教师，身患重大疾病的教师，可以自愿决定是否申报。不申报的，仍然担任一线教学工作的，由学校认定为三星级高级教师，享受四星级高级教师待遇；未担任一线教学工作的，由学校认定为三星级高级教师。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">二、星级评定内容<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">师德修养与职业道德：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱社会主义祖国，热爱教育事业，全面贯彻国家教育方针。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）遵守国家法律法规和教育行政部门的有关规定，遵守学校规章制度。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）遵守《教师职业道德规范》，为人师表，敬业爱岗，乐于奉献，认真完成学校安排的教育教学任务，廉洁从教，不参与和教师身份不符的活动。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>）关心学生，爱护学生，尊重学生人格，平等对待和关爱每一个学生，注重全体学生的培养和学生的全面发展。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">教育教学工作：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）落实课堂常规，做到认真备课、上课、批改、辅导、评价、反思，各个环节规范到位。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）课堂教学符合新课程要求，教学环节落实，有扎实的专业知识和良好的教学艺术，能面向全体学生，教学效果好，受到学生欢迎。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）积极参加教研活动，认真听课、评课，能发表指导性意见，能对青年教师提供一些有帮助的建议。定期开设质量较高的校级及以上公开课、观摩课。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>）能积极开展第二课堂活动，并取得一定成效。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>）教书育人，学生学业负担适宜，教育质量高，能胜任各年级特别是毕业班教育教学工作。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>）能根据学校需要，积极承担并胜任班主任工作（校级领导、中层干部、教研组长等可看作班主任工作）。</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">在一个星级评定周期内原则上应担任一年以上班主任工作，或任教以来担任班主任工作满<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>年；体、技、音、美等专业课教师必须有<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>年以上副班主任、政教员、生活指导老师等德育工作经历。（删去）</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">班主任工作认真负责，能深入学生，经常家访，密切联系家长，形成班级合力，班风正，学风浓，班级有凝聚力，学生、家长满意率高。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">教科研与专业发展：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）注重自身专业建设，专业发展有目标，能积极参加继续教育等各类培训，通过不断学习和实践，提高专业水平。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）积极撰写有关教育教学的科研论文或进行课题研究，定期面向青年教师开设学术讲座，解决教育教学中的实际问题，提高教育教学质量。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）积极参与创新型团队、学习型团队建设，在教学、治学中发挥引领作用，在教学、科研团队建设中发挥指导作用，研究成果、学术成果（含教育教学课件等）能在教研组、全校教师中推广和共享，能积极参加先进教研集体等团队竞赛的争创活动。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>）积极参加各种教育教学业务竞赛。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">学校工作：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）顾全大局，服从学校安排，承担规定的教育教学工作或组织安排的其它工作，工作量饱满。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）认真参加师徒结对工作，热心指导青年教师，耐心帮助青年教师，帮扶工作有深度、有效果。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）积极参加教育局、学校组织的支教交流工作，按照要求认真完成支教任务，工作踏实，得到被支教学校的肯定。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>）牢固树立“人人都是德育工作者”的意识，通过各种方式，积极参加学校开展的德育工作，热心做好与学困生、特困生、特殊生的结对工作，及时化解学生思想矛盾，解决学生实际困难，工作有成效。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">三、星级评定方式<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">成立高级教师星级评定考核小组：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">组长：马德尧；副组长：王柏根；<SPAN style="COLOR: black">组员：卢燎亚、陈银伟、卓铭阳、宣方军、刘夏进、赵寅芬<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>陈合力、宋建伟、蒋建棋、郑益芳、桑美娟。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">评定周期与比例：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">星级评定工作三年为一个周期，根据学校星级考评情况，按照比例评出三星、四星、五星级高级教师。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">原则上五星级高级教师不超过全体高级教师的<SPAN lang=EN-US>15%</SPAN>，四星级高级教师不超过全体高级教师的<SPAN lang=EN-US>35%</SPAN>。</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（三年后第二轮评定时，市教育局基本同意分别增加到<SPAN lang=EN-US>25%</SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>50%</SPAN>）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">正校级领导、特级教师、正高级教师、市名师工作室导师由市教育局参与考核评定，不占学校名额。<SPAN lang=EN-US>55</SPAN>岁以上的男高级教师、<SPAN lang=EN-US>50</SPAN>岁以上的女高级教师评为四星级，不占学校名额。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">考核小组根据高级教师申报情况，对照必备条件、选备条件、量化数据等，进行审核评议，确定相应等级，经过公示，报市教育局审定。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">星级评定周期中，初次聘任的高级教师可以在聘任后一个月内提出申请，由考核小组评定。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">四、星级评定条件<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（一）必备条件<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">星级评定内容中的四方面要求作为各星级教师应具备的必备条件。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">符合聘任高级教师职务的年限：五星级要求任高级教师职务满<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>年，四星级要求任高级教师职务满<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>年。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">教学效果好，在各类考试中，所教班级学生成绩优良。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（二）选备条件<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">五星级高级教师选备条件（任高级教师以来符合下列条件其中<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN></SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（改为<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">条）：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）评为市级先进等。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）所带班级评为市级先进班级等。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）评为市属名师培养人选、市属学科带头人、市教坛新秀，由市教育局组织的市属教学比武一等奖，市优质课一等奖，省优质课一、二等奖等。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>）论文获市一等奖，省一、二等奖等，或入选市学术主题报告，或在国家核心刊物上发表，或在省级刊物上发表<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>篇；或主编的教材、教育专著、专业学术专著正式出版。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>）课题成果获市一等奖，省一、二等奖等。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>）辅导学生获省赛区一、二等奖，全国一、二、三等奖等。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">四星级高级教师选备条件（任高级教师以来符合下列条件其中<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>条）：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）评为市属级先进等，或校级先进两次。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）所带班级评为市属级先进班级等。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）评为市属名师培养人选、市属学科带头人、市属教坛新秀，由市教育局组织的市属教学比武一等奖，市属优质课一等奖，市优质课一、二等奖等。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>）论文获市属一等奖，市一、二等奖等，或入选市学术主题报告，或在省级刊物上发表；或主编的教材、教育专著、专业学术专著正式出版。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>）课题成果获市属一等奖，市一、二等奖等。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>）辅导学生获市一等奖，省一、二等奖等。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">五、星级评定数据量化统计办法<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">以下各项都从任高级教师以来开始计分。<SPAN lang=EN-US> <o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">担任班主任工作，每年<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>分。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">满工作量再担任政教员工作，每年<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>分。<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                                                                                      </SPAN><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">任教高三年级：文化课教师每年<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>分，其它教师<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>分。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">聘为高级教师，每年<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>分。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">4. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">最近六年教学质量方面：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 17.65pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.47; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）文理科高考（当年任课教师）：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">15</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">班（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>届除外）、<SPAN lang=EN-US>16</SPAN>班语文教师所教学生平均分（折算成<SPAN lang=EN-US>100</SPAN>分）超过全市平均分<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>分加<SPAN lang=EN-US>9.4</SPAN>分，其它学科超<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>分加<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>分。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
