<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; tab-stops: 24.0pt 85.5pt 195.75pt 279.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">30</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">分<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P></TD>
<TD style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: #ece9d8; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 18pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt">
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; tab-stops: 24.0pt 85.5pt 195.75pt 279.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">25</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">分<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; tab-stops: 24.0pt 97.5pt 177.75pt 267.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><SPAN style="mso-tab-count: 1">    </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">同一项目只计最高分。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96; tab-stops: 24.0pt 97.5pt 177.75pt 267.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">几省联合的比赛按省级计分。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96; tab-stops: 24.0pt 97.5pt 177.75pt 267.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">以上四项，小计限高<SPAN lang=EN-US>40</SPAN>分。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">六、星级教师管理办法<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">高级教师有下列情形之一的，一经查实，取消评审资格；已经取得星级资格的，撤销其称号，取消有关待遇：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">评选工作中弄虚作假的。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">无正当理由不服从学校或教育行政机关安排的。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">不具备师德要求或不履行职责，经查实从事有偿家教或违反有关规定到社会力量办学机构兼职的。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">年度考核不合格的，学生、家长满意、基本满意率低于<SPAN lang=EN-US>80%</SPAN>的。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">5.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">三年一次专业知识测评不合格的。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">6.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">因工作失职、失误造成安全责任事故的。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">7.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">其他依照法律、法规应当取消参评资格的。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 20.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.46; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">高级教师星级评定结果不与校内的结构工资、绩效工资等经济待遇挂钩。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 26.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.21; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">本方案经市教育局批准后实施。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 26.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.21; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">本方案由校长室负责解释。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">未尽事宜，由校长室酌情处理。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"></SPAN></FONT> </P>
    
